5	742	local://resumes/candidate_1762/20260421T161646Z_af0e1b0d59.pdf	JITHSUNGH SAI VALLABHANENI\nPhone: +91 7032909135 Email: jithsungh@gmail.com Location: Vijayawada, India\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/jithsung GitHub: github.com/jithsungh Portfolio: jithsungh.vercel.app\nWORK EXPERIENCE\nMember of Technical Staff – Site Reliability Engineer (Intern) TechMojo Solutions\nAug 2025 – Present — Hyderabad, India\n- Monitoring system reliability, performance using observability tools, supporting incident detection and resolution.\n- Gained hands-on experience with ELK Stack, Kafka, Prometheus, Grafana alerting, and system health monitoring.\nResearch Internship SRM AP University, Amaravati\nSummer 2024\n-github.com/jithsungh/AI Brain Tumour Detector\nPROJECTS\nAdaptive knowledge Chatbot – RAG [ FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, ChromaDB, LangChain, JWT ]\ngithub.com/jithsungh/chatbot\n- Enterprise ready chatbot with intelligent department routing using semantic embeddings and keyword matching.\n- Implemented semantic question deduplication & reduced redundant queries by generating canonical summaries.\n- Built an advanced admin dashboard with RBAC, real-time analytics, response monitoring, department-specific\nadmins, and dynamic knowledge-base creation from file(pdf,docx,txt) or text data, including admin FAQs.\nSmart Resume Parser – ML+NLP [ FastAPI, PyMuPDF, EasyOCR, spaCy, Transformers, React ]\ngithub.com/jithsungh/resume parser\n- Built resume parser with intelligent layout detection, achieving 95+% section accuracy across multi-column formats.\n- Implemented adaptive document pipelines with Transformer-based NER to extract experience, skills, contact info.\nNewzzy – Personalized News Feed [ MERN stack, Tailwind CSS, DaisyUI, JWT, Cloudinary, Cron-job ]\ngithub.com/jithsungh/Newzzy\n- Developed a feature-rich news aggregation and AI-powered recommendation platform with JWT authentication.\n- Integrated keyword-based personalization, saved articles, and likes/dislikes, User Streaks, User Activity, Sharing\n- Built modular APIs, responsive UI, dark mode support, and deployed on Vercel (frontend) and Render (backend).\nAI Health Assistant – Generative AI Symptom Analyzer [ React, Node.js, Google Gemini, Google Maps API ]\ngithub.com/jithsungh/ai-health-assistant\n- Built an AI-powered app to analyze symptoms via text or PDF and recommend nearby specialized hospitals.\n- Integrated Gemini API, Google Maps API, and built modular REST APIs with responsive multi-step UI.\nSKILLS\nProgramming Languages: Python, JavaScript, Go, TypeScript, Java, SQL, C++\nFrontend: React.js, HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, Tailwind CSS, Material UI, Figma\nBackend: Python, Golang, Node.js, Express.js, RESTful APIs, WebSockets\nDatabases: MongoDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL, ChromaDB, Firebase Firestore\nCloud & DevOps: AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Git, GitHub, GitLab, Firebase\nAI/ML: Machine Learning, Deep Learning, CNNs, NLP , RAG Systems, LangChain, Vector Databases\nOther Skills: Team Player, Effective Communication, Problem-Solving\nEDUCATION\nSRM AP University, Amaravati B.Tech in Computer Science 2022-2026 CGPA: 9.08\nNarayana Junior College, Vijayawada Class XII (BIEAP) 2022 Percentage: 91.80%\nCSKGTS, Vijayawada Class X (BSEAP) 2020 Percentage: 99.83%\nAWARDS & CERTIFICATIONS\nMongoDB Certified Associate Developer – Global Certification (2025) [https://bit.ly/4nRHJ76]\nAWS Fundamentals – Coursera (2024) [https://bit.ly/3GQ9hJr]\nFundamentals of UI/UX Design – Coursera (2024) [https://bit.ly/4nSiW2R]\nUniversity-Level Club Lead – Professional Societies Club, SRM AP (2024)\n1	{"name": "JITHSUNGH SAI VALLABHANENI", "email": "jithsungh@gmail.com", "phone": "+91 7032909135", "skills": ["python", "java", "javascript", "typescript", "react", "node", "sql", "postgresql", "aws", "docker", "kubernetes", "fastapi", "machine learning", "git", "mongodb"], "source": "local_server_parser", "summary": "JITHSUNGH SAI VALLABHANENI Phone: +91 7032909135 Email: jithsungh@gmail.com Location: V